IT:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Scavare buche è un istinto animale!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Shhh! {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sto lavorando a dei tunnel
segreti. {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}It's in a man's nature to catch bugs!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I wanna catch bugs bigger than
anyone else has ever caught!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ho l'istinto di un predatore!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Rincorrere gli insetti
è naturale per me!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Böcek yakalamak erkeğin doğasında var!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Herkesinkinden daha büyük böcekler
yakalamak istiyorum!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}It's in a man's nature to fish!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I wanna catch bigger fish than
any man has ever caught before!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}La pesca è un hobby adatto a me.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}È uno sport solitario dove si sente
solo il rumore dell'acqua...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Balık tutmak erkeğin doğasında var!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Kimsenin yakalamadığı kadar büyük bir
balık yakalamak istiyorum!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Horticulture is in a man's blood!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I wanna grow a garden that
makes everyone else jealous!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Bahçıvanlık erkeğin kanında var!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Herkesi kıskandıracak bir bahçe
